      <div class="day-section soccer">
        <div class="label">Soccer Session — Transition + Defending <span class="req">req</span> · 55–65 min</div>

        <div class="position-legend">
          <span class="pl-label">Drill Focus</span>
          <span class="pl-key"><span class="pos irb">IRB</span> Inverted Right Back</span>
