          </div>
          <div class="drill-line"><div class="name"><strong>Pyramid runs</strong> · 30-40-50-40-30 yards · walk-back rest · pace 85%<span class="pos-tags"><span class="pos both">BOTH</span></span></div><div class="scheme">2 sets</div></div>
          <div class="drill-line"><div class="name"><strong>Repeat sprints — RB profile</strong> · 6 × 40 yds @ 85% · 60 sec rest · simulates overlap-and-recover<span class="pos-tags"><span class="pos irb">IRB</span></span></div><div class="scheme">6 reps</div></div>
          <div class="drill-line"><div class="name"><strong>Curved runs — winger arc</strong> · arc out wide then cut into the box · 30 yds<span class="pos-tags"><span class="pos lw">LW</span></span><span class="why">The exact run a winger makes attacking the back post. Curved, not straight — buys separation from the centre back.</span></div><div class="scheme">4 reps</div></div>
          <div class="drill-line"><div class="name"><strong>Walk + water break</strong> · full recovery before Block 04</div><div class="scheme">2-3 min</div></div>
        </div>

        <div class="session-block">
          <div class="block-head">
            <span class="block-num">BLOCK 04</span>
            <span class="block-title">Technical Under Fatigue</span>
            <span class="block-time">12 MIN</span>
          </div>
