      <div class="body">
        <p>The minimum effective dose. Three exercises, three minutes, gets the deep core firing before any session — lift OR soccer. <strong>Skipping this is fine on individual days; skipping it for a whole week shows up as tweaked low-back during heavy squats or strikes.</strong> Habit is the point.</p>
        <div class="module-routine">
