      <div class="body">
        <p>The "striking and switching" routine. Builds the hip-to-shoulder rotational drive that powers your right-foot diagonal switches (TFA-style) and your left-half-space curling shots. <strong>Two-footed players need both directions trained equally</strong> — most people only develop their dominant rotation. Don't be most people.</p>
        <div class="module-routine">
          <h5>Routine — 8 min · post-Tue soccer</h5>
